HDPRA-56#1 Advisory
Narrow Gap without Location Constraints  
RP pblock 'pblock_dynamic_region' contains a narrow gap that may impact implementation results.  Removing the gap by absorbing the locations into the RP pblock may improve implementation and allow for continuous placement.  TAG='56_G76_RP1_S'.  Use the following command to adjust the RP to include the locations in the gap: 
